{"id":3123,"author":"Joao_Victor","body":"Take a test here:\u0026nbsp;\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://www.speedtest.net/\"\u003ehttp://www.speedtest.net/\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;to find out your upload and download speed.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhen you're done, click \"Share Result\"\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThen go to \"Image\"\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAnd copy the link, and paste it here.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMine:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.speedtest.net/result/3608670287.png\"\u003e","body_tagged":"Take a test here:\u0026nbsp;\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://www.speedtest.net/\"\u003ehttp://www.speedtest.net/\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;to find out your upload and download speed.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhen you're done, click \"Share Result\"\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThen go to \"Image\"\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAnd copy the link, and paste it here.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMine:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.speedtest.net/result/3608670287.png\"\u003e","created_at":1404714912,"title":"What's your internet speed?","replies":[{"id":34320,"author":"TheOpAmerican","body":"\u003cimg width=\"300\" height=\"135\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.speedtest.net/result/3608676275.png\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNolan is faster than 69% of the USA","body_tagged":"\u003cimg width=\"300\" height=\"135\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.speedtest.net/result/3608676275.png\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNolan is faster than 69% of the USA","created_at":1404715340},{"id":34321,"author":"Numberz_","body":"\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/eLSbGv3.jpg%5B/IMG%5D\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDon't know how to use the link it gave me.","body_tagged":"\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/eLSbGv3.jpg%5B/IMG%5D\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDon't know how to use the link it gave me.","created_at":1404715391},{"id":34323,"author":"TheOpAmerican","body":"What I did:\u003cbr\u003e\